\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Supplementary Figure 4: Data Cleaning and Preparation Steps\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Supplementary Figure 4 presents joinpoint regression analysis of monthly US deceased donor transplant rates (January 2015\'96December 2024) using active waitlist size as the rate denominator, stratified by donor mechanism of death: drug overdose, non-drug overdose, and overall. Panel A shows kidney transplants and Panel B shows liver transplants. Rates are expressed per 1,000 actively waitlisted patients. Crude rates are calculated using the NCI Joinpoint Regression Program Version 5.4 (detailed settings in manuscript Methods section).\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

